***************************************************************************
This file contains the definition of the links that should appear in the
System Status Navigation menu and the action that should be taken for each link.
***************************************************************************
This menu deliberately contains no content in EBI R400. This is by design: 
almost all of the status displays have been superseeded by the top-level
system status display, and so this menu is just a placeholder for
backwards compatibility until the remaining displays are removed entirely.
***************************************************************************
-->
<Menu Caption="System Status" Icon="omSystemStatus_30x30.png" xmlns="http://tempuri.org/SystemMenu.xsd">
